title: "DarkMoon Visualization Research"
abstract: "Research record of the DarkMoon visualization work (Mar-Nov 2026): Angular dashboard redesign, attack-path graphs (layered, Atlas 2D, orbital 3D/WebXR), executive views and the Terminal Explorer TUI, with real before/after captures on synthetic demo data, decision records, rejected attempts and the measures that exist."
